      "hash": "12da79d4123ae8e0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MR. FUJI: ... ... ..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0820_fuji_03",
      "hash": "12da7ad4123aea93",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh? And who might you be?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0820_fuji_04",
      "hash": "12da7fd4123af312",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You came to save me from Team Rocket?\\nThanks, but I didn’t even notice they were here.\\c\\nI was too busy trying to calm the spirit of\\nMarowak."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0820_fuji_05",
      "hash": "12da80d4123af4c5",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I think Marowak’s spirit has finally left us.\\c\\nI must thank you for your kind concern."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0820_fuji_06",
      "hash": "12da7dd4123aefac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Follow me to my home.\\nIt’s the Pokémon House, at the foot of this tower."
    }
  ],
